This set card can't be discarded by the opponent.

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
Summon/deploy up to one "The DemonArmyFlagbearer Amon" from your Trash, without paying the cost. If you control three or more "The DemonArmyFlagbearer Amon", including those in Trash/pre-advent condition, instead, summon/deploy up to one Purple "Bannerace" family card from your Trash, without paying the cost. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.
